From: PiSight development <pisight@local>
Subject: [PATCH] Remove shutter monitoring and frame freezing

Keep GPIO control for the running and streaming LEDs only. Accept the old
three-pin argument for compatibility but never configure or read the shutter
pin. Streaming follows the host independently of the physical cover.

The image also starts pigpiod with alerts disabled to remove its continuous
sampling CPU thread; ordinary LED reads and writes remain available.

--- a/include/uvcgadget/gpio.h
+++ b/include/uvcgadget/gpio.h
